+    "\t    Use NV_path_rendering OpenGL and OpenGL ES extension.\n"
+    "\tsamples\ttype: int\tdefault: 0.\n"
+    "\t    Use multisampling with N samples.\n"
+    "\tstencils\ttype: bool\tdefault: true.\n"
+    "\t    Allow the use of stencil buffers.\n"
